{
 "source": "an expired intermediate CA under a trusted root (PKIX path validation failed, CertPathValidatorException) fails a fire-and-forget afterAction webhook under CUSTOM trust; the oracle's LOG_ENTRIES then fails to serialize the entry (500), as for the PKIX path building failure in webhook_tls_untrusted_log_entries. tests/files/x509/forward-trust/gen-probe.sh",
